ek volgt hun gescheiden pogingen een uitweg te vinden terwijl de macht van de Asteri hun mogelijkheden beperkt.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1810349/huis-van-vuur-schaduw.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789463107952","key":{"isbn_13":"9789463107952"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100045,"title":"Reckless","isbn_13":"9789463107952","isbn_10":"9463107959","language":"nld","publisher":"Pelckmans uitgevers","id":975200115}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789463107952","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789463107952"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-03-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1941074/reckless.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1941074/reckless.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000646651_Reckless_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T23:12:30.006Z","sha256":"39895088d433f73997068418f3407ab811e2ddff3f3e2676a9dcf4821269f13b","bytes":466110,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789463107952","work_id":975100045,"bound_author_id":969300016,"bound_title":"Reckless","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789463107952","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000646651_Reckless_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1941074/reckless.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:1914:nl","key":{"work_id":975100045,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-03-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1941074/reckless.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1941074/reckless.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000646651_Reckless_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T23:12:30.006Z","sha256":"39895088d433f73997068418f3407ab811e2ddff3f3e2676a9dcf4821269f13b","bytes":466110,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":975100045,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":969300016,"text":"Na de gebeurtenissen in Ilya moet Paedyn vluchten. Kai krijgt als nieuwe Handhaver opdracht haar op te sporen, hoewel zijn gevoelens die taak bemoeilijken. De achtervolging brengt hen in een vijandige omgeving waar geen van beiden zich op vertrouwde zekerheden kan verlaten. Het tweede Powerless-boek zet hun persoonlijke band onder druk door bevelen van het hof, gevaar en de gevolgen van eerdere keuzes.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1941074/reckless.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789463839907","key":{"isbn_13":"9789463839907"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100046,"title":"Fearless","isbn_13":"9789463839907","isbn_10":"9463839909","language":"nld","publisher":"Pelckmans uitgevers","id":975200116}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789463839907","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789463839907"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-03-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1970514/fearless.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1970514/fearless.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000709403_Fearless_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T23:12:31.855Z","sha256":"4027763ca97cdbb23934ae93db094c2eb54d1558cc051d66e11e6285fe5be459","bytes":218340,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789463839907","work_id":975100046,"bound_author_id":969300016,"bound_title":"Fearless","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789463839907","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000709403_Fearless_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1970514/fearless.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:1915:nl","key":{"work_id":975100046,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-03-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1970514/fearless.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1970514/fearless.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000709403_Fearless_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T23:12:31.855Z","sha256":"4027763ca97cdbb23934ae93db094c2eb54d1558cc051d66e11e6285fe5be459","bytes":218340,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":975100046,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":969300016,"text":"Paedyn en Kai keren terug naar Ilya, maar aan het hof wacht een besluit dat hun toekomst ingrijpend kan veranderen. Hun verbondenheid maakt de politieke situatie niet eenvoudiger. Terwijl ook de mensen om hen heen door de nieuwe verhoudingen worden geraakt, moet Paedyn bepalen welke ruimte zij nog heeft om zelf te handelen. Dit derde Powerless-boek brengt liefde en verantwoordelijkheid voor het koninkrijk tegenover elkaar.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1970514/fearless.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789062226856","key":{"isbn_13":"9789062226856"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100047,"title":"King of envy","isbn_13":"9789062226856","isbn_10":"906222685X","language":"nld","publisher":"Singel Uitgeverijen","id":975200117}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789062226856","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789062226856"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-03-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/2048707/king-of-envy.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/2048707/king-of-envy.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000743517_King_of_envy_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T23:12:33.677Z","sha256":"560900ccbf7def396f8df791ceef624322f39d0befd9a1a0ed04fc53e05247ff","bytes":480669,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789062226856","work_id":975100047,"bound_author_id":924300405,"bound_title":"King of envy","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789062226856","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000743517_King_of_envy_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/2048707/king-of-envy.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:1916:nl","key":{"work_id":975100047,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-03-20261101","evi